                            >
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                A PDF exported from Word, Google Docs, or
                                InDesign typically carries: Author (your full
                                name), Creator (the software), ModDate (last
                                edit timestamp), Company (your registered
                                company name if set in Office), and sometimes
                                Keywords or Subject fields containing previous
                                client names from templates.
                            </div>
                        </div>
